SY_TALK("2rN-Fx4GAqo",[[0,["Today I was thinking of talking, telling you","about the Sahaja Culture."]],[25,["Now we are formed in dharma, Vishwa Dharma."]],[32,["But it must have a culture."]],[35,["So far in all the religions there is no combination","of religion and culture."]],[42,["No religion has."]],[45,["That's why everywhere you find different cultures."]],[48,["Say in India, people who follow Hindu religion","have different cultures in different places."]],[54,["They are living in Lucknow, or say in U.P.,","they have a Muslim culture."]],[60,["More Islamic style."]],[62,["They'll eat in one plate, do all kinds of","things which normally a South Indian won't"]],[67,["do, and the South Indians have a different","culture from Maharashtrians."]],[73,["So even in a religion like Hindu religion","where culture is important, very important,"]],[79,["we find varieties."]],[82,["So the cultures get influenced by the neighboring","cultures or surrounding cultures, and that's"]],[88,["how people get lost."]],[93,["When you establish a religion like this, Vishwa","Dharma, it's not like any other religion."]],[98,["It's the real religion within us, and this","reality comes to us because now we are one"]],[105,["with the Spirit."]],[106,["So when we talk of Sahaja Culture, it is the","culture of the Spirit."]],[112,["Now what is a culture?"]],[113,["First of all let us see what is a culture","is."]],[116,["So the culture is the pattern of behavior","we have with others."]],[122,["Is a common pattern of behavior we are supposed","to have with others."]],[127,["Like in English language, for example, we'll","say \"Thank you\"."]],[131,["Even if somebody murders, you may say, \"Thank","you\"."]],[135,["Or the person who murders you can say, \"Sorry\"."]],[142,["On the phone one may say, just if they say","something you can't hear, \"Sorry?\""]],[147,["Every time, \"Sorry\"."]],[148,["As if \"sorry\" is a word so easily to be used."]],[151,["I mean if you are sorry, why are you sorry","for that?"]],[153,["\"Sorry?\""]],[154,["On the phone they used to first say, \"I beg","your pardon?\", was sensible; but now I find"]],[158,["everybody, A to Z, says, \"Sorry?\""]],[161,["I mean, it has no meaning, because what are","you sorry about?"]],[165,["Says \"Sorry?\""]],[167,["For everything they are sorry."]],[168,["Or we can say in English language, when we","speak, \"I'm afraid\"."]],[170,["You see, it's very common, \"I'm afraid\"."]],[173,["What are you afraid of?"]],[175,["The whole world is afraid of you."]],[176,["So this is the culture, what we talk of, any","culture as such, becomes artificial, is not"]],[186,["spontaneous, doesn't come from reality."]],[188,["It has no meaning; sometimes it is pointless,","absolutely pointless to stick to certain cultures."]],[195,["So the culture of the Spirit doesn't change."]],[198,["It's universal, and is higher than any other","culture."]],[204,["Apart from that it integrates all the essences","of all the cultures."]],[207,["So","it emanates from the spirit."]],[216,["Now, spirit has two sides."]],[219,["One side which you see, the another you don't","see, like the moon."]],[224,["The side you see is outside with other people,","other Sahaja Yogis, other people, other societies,"]],[230,["which are not yourself, absolutely."]],[238,["The other side you don't see is the relationship","with God Almighty, relationship with your"]],[245,["Mother."]],[246,["If the other side is not all right, the behavioral","side outside could become artificial, could"]],[256,["become crooked and not Sahaj."]],[259,["So it's the other way round than any other","culture."]],[264,["To know any other culture what do we go?"]],[265,["We see how they talk, what is their language,","how they speak, how they behave: all the outside"]],[271,["things we get."]],[272,["We must know \"thank you\" if we want to know","English language, must know \"thank you\", \"please\","]],[279,["all that."]],[280,["But if you want to know the Sahaja culture,","you have to know your Mother, and you have"]],[286,["to know God Almighty."]],[288,["And the relationship between your Mother and","the God Almighty has to be absolutely perfect."]],[295,["Then there's no problem."]],[299,["But that, the relationship, if it is not all","right, you cannot have artificial Sahaj culture."]],[307,["That is one thing for sure."]],[309,["Artificial Sahaj culture is not all right."]],[313,["I would say that India has, in its basics,","the culture of the spirit, India has; because"]],[320,["for traditions and traditions in India, and","for ages, people have been seeking the truth."]],[333,["Spiritually they are endowed, because of the","saints."]],[340,["They are blessed specially because they have","been seekers, not of material things, but"]],[349,["of the spirit."]],[350,["Specially in Maharashtra, we should say, because","the Kundalini is there always like a magnet."]],[358,["People are attracted because Shri Ganesha","being the magnet, attracted towards God and"]],[364,["spirit."]],[365,["So they form a pattern, but there is lot of","artificiality in that also has grown."]],[370,["We must admit that there is lot, lot of artificiality,","falsehood, nonsense that has grown into it,"]],[379,["because the religion fell into the hands of,","spiritual religion fell into the hands of"]],[385,["gross, horrible so-called Brahmins who were","not realized souls."]],[389,["So the whole culture has become so nonsensical","sometimes that you don't know where to look."]],[396,["But to have the culture, first of all, culture","is developed through meditation, by facing"]],[407,["yourself."]],[410,["First of all you should face yourself, how","you feel about your Mother and about God Almighty."]],[422,["First of all, how much liberty you take of","your Mother?"]],[429,["How much granted, take for granted your Mother?"]],[434,["She's a Mahamaya."]],[440,["Even the first \"M\" is difficult to understand."]],[444,["So when you start taking liberties, all the","time putting your pressure on Her, all the"]],[452,["time trying to attract Her attention, Her","time, or writing letters eleven pages, all"]],[462,["that, is one side."]],[464,["Another side is complete indifference to your","Mother."]],[469,["So it is to be known through your heart."]],[471,["You don't have to talk to Me."]],[474,["I know whose heart is pulsating."]],[479,["Perhaps I'm the only person who knows really","what you are."]],[485,["You may not be knowing yourself also."]],[487,["I may not say, but I know you in all details,","out of which I may say little bit, because"]],[496,["I am too gentle to say things."]],[501,["Because again of Sahaj culture."]],[503,["Because of Sahaj culture, I cannot say everything","to you on your face."]],[509,["I'm correcting it, trying to correct it, correct","it; if not possible, then I say to you."]],[514,["Then in that you have to also see how much","worshipful you are."]],[518,["Some people, though they spend more time with","Me, remain with Me, want to be with Me, it"]],[525,["is only when they feel surrendered, also."]],[531,["So it should not be confused: if somebody","is spending more time with Me, you should"]],[534,["not condemn yourself for that."]],[536,["It's all right."]],[537,["But how far you are surrendered is the point."]],[541,["Now, if you are surrendered, how do you see","the surrendering in a person?"]],[545,["You see it has one side and the another is","the expression."]],[552,["Say a person who is surrendered doesn't talk","much to Me, doesn't talk, he listens, doesn't"]],[561,["talk."]],[562,["Common sense, he listens."]],[568,["Even people who are very good, I've seen when","I'm talking, they'll put in their own words"]],[574,["in between."]],[576,["People who are very good, I should say."]],[579,["So the surrendering is not full."]],[581,["Then the time, they become very conscious","of the time."]],[584,["Who has made the time?"]],[589,["But the person won't come directly and tell","Me, but tell somebody else, \"Go and tell Mother,"]],[592,["She has to go at this time.\""]],[594,["I know everything, who tells whom, who goes","to whom, who is telling someone, who is time-bound."]],[603,["And then I flout it."]],[607,["I know what time to reach, what is the auspicious","time, how it will work out."]],[613,["Surrendering has to be to that point, that","you shouldn't worry."]],[617,["I would say Dumahl is one of them who is a","very great surrendered fellow."]],[621,["When I went there I was very tired, and he","said."]],[624,["\"Mother, if You want to rest You can rest.\""]],[627,["I said, \"Yes, I want to rest.\""]],[628,["So he just left Me alone."]],[629,["I was really very tired because I had a very","long journey, and then this and that, and"]],[635,["then I went down all the way there."]],[638,["I thought, \"I'll lie down, and sleep off."]],[641,["\" Of course, as I know that everything has","to be done at right time, I just went down."]],[649,["And we had a program of My reception at one","place in a village, and they were all waiting"]],[659,["for Me there."]],[662,["And I was sleeping; he wouldn't wake Me up."]],[663,["He wouldn't wake Me up."]],[664,["He said, \"Everything will be all right."]],[668,["Tell them when Mother will come.\""]],[671,["So there was sun on, they were all sitting","under the tree, sun was scorchingly hot."]],[675,["They were nicely having a nice nap under the","tree and all that."]],[680,["All the villagers arrived, everybody arrived,","everything worked out."]],[685,["And when I got up it was about five-thirty,","then he told Me that, \"Mother, I didn't tell"]],[690,["You the program.\""]],[691,["He never tells Me."]],[692,["If I get something written, well and good,","but, \"You were sleeping, I didn't want to"]],[696,["disturb You.\""]],[697,["\"What's the program?\""]],[698,["\"It was at three o'clock.\""]],[699,["I said, \"Three o'clock."]],[700,["Why didn't you tell Me?"]],[701,["Why didn't you wake Me?\""]],[703,["He said, \"You were awake, I knew You were","awake, Mother."]],[706,["It's all right.\""]],[707,["So we started off at six o'clock."]],[716,["Sun had gone down."]],[717,["By that time they arranged beautiful lights","and fireworks and everything, and all the"]],[724,["rushing about was finished, they're very well","settled."]],[728,["And the people from distant villages had also","arrived, and they had organized them so well,"]],[733,["and they had a proper time, and are very happy","that I came late because sun was not there,"]],[738,["so scorchingly hot."]],[739,["By the time we reached about seven o'clock","it was night and they illumined the lights,"]],[746,["and the diwali like this was put up everywhere,","and they got everything, they had sufficient"]],[752,["time to do everything."]],[754,["Then Dumahl said, \"I knew, Mother, You are","awake, and You were managing.\""]],[763,["If one can understand that, then you will","not try to organize Me."]],[767,["You can just tell Me, \"We have to leave at","this time.\""]],[771,["But if I don't have to leave, I will not leave","whatever you may do."]],[777,["In My own sweet way; you will never find Me","obstinate, but I am."]],[785,["Because I know what is right is what is right,","and has to be done that way."]],[789,["But otherwise I'm very calm, I am not bothered."]],[792,["I never organize you, I never hurry you, I","never do anything that should upset you."]],[798,["Spirit is never upset, never excited, never","hurries, and never is what you call that \"go-go\""]],[808,["business."]],[810,["Like now, we have to go to the airport."]],[812,["You'll find everybody was like an aeroplane","- round, round, round, round."]],[817,["What has happened?"]],[818,["\"Oh, we had to go?"]],[819,["We'd..\""]],[820,["\"We have to go, all right."]],[821,["So what?\""]],[822,["The whole thing is, all these excitements","and all these things come to us because we"]],[828,["are outside."]],[829,["But if you are one with your spirit you're","absolutely calm, absolutely calm, \"All right,"]],[831,["we have to go, all right, we'll reach there."]],[836,["Doesn't matter.\""]],[837,["The other day we had to go for some shopping,","I was trying to buy some saris for Indian"]],[843,["ladies."]],[844,["We got lost."]],[845,["I never bothered them at all."]],[846,["They were going round and round, and round","and round."]],[849,["And then Danny realized and said, \"I think","perhaps we had to leave vibrations in all"]],[853,["these places.\""]],[854,["I said, \"Correct.\""]],[856,["And for about two hours I think, we were roaming","about."]],[859,["Anybody else would be saying, \"What's this?"]],[861,["You can't find the place, what's the matter","with you?”"]],[864,["Calm."]],[865,["We reached the shop at the right time, got","everything at the right time, did everything,"]],[870,["came back at right time."]],[871,["Everything was first class, nothing went wrong."]],[874,["But anybody in My place, I tell you, that","time would have been, \"Oh God, this, that.\""]],[879,["Why are you saving time?"]],[880,["For what are you saving time?"]],[885,["So we miss the present, and that's one thing","spirit never misses."]],[889,["It's always in the present."]],[892,["That's the reality."]],[896,["Now in the West people are very futuristic,","extremely futuristic, and their futuristicness"]],[902,["sometimes takes them to points, say for example","if they have to go by train."]],[908,["So instead of arriving at the right station,","they'll go to the station which is further"]],[911,["on."]],[913,["And then again they'll arrive at the further","on."]],[915,["The train will never reach them."]],[917,["Sort of temperament they have."]],[921,["So one should not plan at all anything like","that, that fixes you."]],[928,["But at this moment, if I have to be told that","we have to go at this time, is all right,"]],[933,["finished now."]],[934,["At this moment I've told, is recorded, finished."]],[936,["All right?"]],[937,["So it's gone into the memory."]],[939,["There's nothing to worry about it now."]],[941,["Now, present moment, what are we doing?"]],[943,["In a very calm way, witness it."]],[947,["Witness yourself, now, witness yourself."]],[950,["\"Where is my mind going?\""]],[953,["Now somebody who has to cook must be thinking,","\"Oh, I have to get this, I have to get that.\""]],[959,["Once you start saying that \"I have to do it\",","you'll never be able to do it that way."]],[964,["But you said, \"All right, just now I'm in","meditation.\""]],[971,["Every moment, \"I am in meditation.\""]],[974,["Everything will walk up to you, even matter,","and you'll get the right things at the right"]],[981,["place."]],[983,["You'll meet right people at the right place."]],[988,["The other day we were just walking, strolling","around."]],[991,["Whom do we find there?"]],[993,["Carolyn."]],[994,["She just walked out."]],[996,["There is she, I mean I met her."]],[1000,["She said, \"Christine is just next door.\""]],[1002,["I said, \"Let's go,\" and you should have seen","the joy on her face when she came down, and"]],[1007,["she saw Me."]],[1008,["Beautiful experience for Me and her, she was","so happy."]],[1013,["Then we went together."]],[1015,["So when you have so much tied down with your","watch, that means you are not tied down with"]],[1022,["your spirit."]],[1025,["So a Sahaja yogi, if he sees watch, then he's","not a Sahaja yogi."]],[1033,["But the other side could be that the Sahaja","yogis are never in time where they have to"]],[1038,["be."]],[1040,["Very common in England."]],[1042,["I reach always first, to open the door."]],[1046,["And to clean it also sometimes."]],[1053,["Now, to take for granted things, as you say,","take for granted, that's not the way Sahaja"]],[1061,["Yoga is."]],[1062,["You have to be alert, alert, absolutely alert."]],[1065,["If you are alert, immediately you'll know","\"I have to go now at this time."]],[1069,["I have to do it."]],[1071,["I have to get this thing now.\""]],[1075,["If you have to miss something, you are supposed","to miss it."]],[1079,["That's what it is."]],[1080,["So, there's a beautiful thing written down,","like they say, \"Jai sei rakhahu tase hi rahun\""]],[1086,["- \"The way You keep me, the way I am, will","be happy.\""]],[1091,["So, satisfaction towards yourself, your spirit,","is important."]],[1096,["Because ego will plan out, \"Oh, we'll go there,","we must get for Mother, say, daisies\", we"]],[1104,["decide."]],[1105,["\"Must get daisies.\""]],[1106,["You don't find daisies, you're disappointed."]],[1107,["Why not?"]],[1108,["These are all My flowers, whether they are","daisies or not, they look so nice."]],[1112,["Whatever you get, you get it."]],[1116,["That's the thing wanted."]],[1117,["You know that, that the Divine is working","out everything for you."]],[1124,["When you are supposed to get something else,","better have it."]],[1128,["Even by mistake, if I lay My hand upon some","things, like a book or something, immediately"]],[1136,["I'll open it out and see why this book has","come in My attention; why this fellow has"]],[1140,["come in My attention; why this is happening."]],[1145,["And immediately I find that there’s some","connection, something has to be done, something"]],[1151,["has to be said, something has to be worked","out."]],[1154,["So for a person who is imbibed with the culture","of spirit, the Sahaj culture, impresses others"]],[1165,["by his calmness and relaxed attitude."]],[1170,["Relaxation never means lethargy, by any chance."]],[1174,["It doesn't mean lethargy."]],[1176,["Lethargy is against relaxation."]],[1179,["A person who is relaxed cannot become lethargic."]],[1182,["\"Relaxed\" means a person who’s alert and","calm."]],[1187,["These two things for human beings is an impossibility,","because if they are alert, if they are alert"]],[1200,["then they're not calm."]],[1202,["If they're unhappy, sad, then they think they","are very, very calm."]],[1208,["So this is one of the things one has to remember,","that you have to witness yourself all the"]],[1213,["time."]],[1215,["Not to condemn yourself, but witness."]],[1217,["Now I said the word \"witness\" means \"detached\"."]],[1220,["Now what happens with this, when you start","condemning yourself, you miss every good point."]],[1226,["For example, you have some experience of a","sudden height being achieved."]],[1237,["All right?"]],[1239,["At that point you should catch hold of it,","hold on to it, keep doing, but don't forget"]],[1246,["that you may go back, no."]],[1249,["And then wait for another higher moment to","come, hold on to it."]],[1253,["That's how you climb Himalayas."]],[1256,["But not that, \"Oh Ma."]],[1258,["Now it's all right, but what will happen next?\""]],[1262,["Then you are gone down, because you have to","face yourself in the way, knowing what are"]],[1269,["your powers."]],[1270,["You are a spirit now, you are no more an ordinary","human being, so you have no business to condemn"]],[1275,["yourself, or to degrade yourself, or in any","way to feel unhappy."]],[1281,["No way."]],[1282,["Past is past."]],[1284,["What happened a moment before is finished."]],[1286,["\"Now I am going to rise."]],[1287,["Now I am going to rise.\""]],[1292,["So a person who has a Sahaja culture is not","only spontaneous, but is inspired, is a inspired"]],[1305,["personality."]],[1307,["A person who is of that kind, an inspired","visionary, then other people get impressed"]],[1317,["by such a person that, \"See, there's a man","who's inspired, who talks in an inspired way,"]],[1325,["in a way that is something very different","from others.\""]],[1329,["Something new he says, new that is nourishing."]],[1335,["Such a personality - like the other day, you","see, we heard the lectures of so many people,"]],[1342,["and when the New Zealand Prime Minister was","coming C.P. said, \"Now let's go back, because"]],[1349,["we'll have a little tea or something.\""]],[1350,["I said: \"No, you listen to this man."]],[1352,["He's a realized soul.\""]],[1353,["He said, \"Really?\""]],[1354,["I said, \"Yes, you listen to him.\""]],[1355,["First everybody was, \"He's sitting in New","Zealand, such a little titwit of a country,"]],[1359,["what is he going to speak?\""]],[1361,["You see, they were moving about, making a…"]],[1363,["Within two minutes he captured everybody's","attention, you see, and he was bubbling with"]],[1368,["everything, so beautifully, and he spoke all","the points so much different, and so much"]],[1375,["new and so much better."]],[1376,["C.P. was amazed."]],[1377,["He said, \"How do You know?\""]],[1379,["I said, \"I know, because when I was in New","Zealand I told them he's a realized soul.\""]],[1384,["And our own Prime Minister is also a realized","soul."]],[1388,["You'll be surprised, after our Prime Minister","finished his lecture and all that, after two"]],[1392,["or three lectures he was to go; then he turned","round and went to this Australian [Shri Mataji"]],[1398,["may have meant New Zealand] Prime Minister,","only him, went and congratulated him, congratulated"]],[1402,["him."]],[1403,["Congratulated and said something very close","to him."]],[1406,["And the fellow again, you see, flew up into","joy."]],[1410,["We see it's all there."]],[1412,["And then he came away."]],[1414,["Why?"]],[1415,["Because one realized soul understands another","realized soul, and everybody was amazed: why"]],[1420,["did he turn to this man alone, and went and","congratulated him?"]],[1424,["So such a large country like India represented","by our Prime Minister, goes down all the way"]],[1431,["to a little country like New Zealand which","is nothing compared to India, and congratulates."]],[1437,["And that's a developed country, this is a","developing country."]],[1439,["Is something people did not understand."]],[1442,["And the whole joyous atmosphere both of them","shaking hands created."]],[1446,["This is Sahaja culture, in which you recognize","a realized soul, the dignity of a realized"]],[1455,["soul."]],[1457,["So when it comes to relating to others, first","and foremost are Sahaja yogis."]],[1463,["But I've seen most of the people are more","congenial with others, and less congenial"]],[1470,["with Sahaja yogis."]],[1473,["They try to criticize Sahaja yogis all the","time, and I test them."]],[1479,["I sometimes say, \"All right."]],[1481,["I don't think this fellow is very good\" and","all that."]],[1484,["But when the other person turns round and","shows compassion and says, \"No, Mother, I"]],[1488,["think it will work out\" then I like it."]],[1493,["I like that."]],[1494,["Or else sometimes I say, \"Oh, let them go","away."]],[1498,["There should be no more food for them, it's","all right.\""]],[1501,["No, Mother, we've made food for them.\""]],[1505,["So the culture of Sahaj is to give."]],[1509,["Give, and give, and give, and never ask for","a reward."]],[1515,["Never thinks, \"What I have to get\"."]],[1518,["After all, you have got the highest that anybody","could get."]],[1525,["They said the three heights a human being","can achieve in spirituality, which you all"]],[1530,["got in no time."]],[1532,["It's called as salokya, samipya, sanidya."]],[1540,["Salokya is that you should be able to see","God."]],[1545,["That you got."]],[1549,["Samipya is the closeness with God."]],[1556,["Sanidya is the togetherness, togetherness."]],[1561,["You have got all these three."]],[1569,["In one incarnation you've got it."]],[1572,["When Gods incarnated before, nobody knew that","they were Gods."]],[1586,["So even they got it, they never knew."]],[1589,["Very few people knew about them."]],[1595,["But even when Christ said He was the Son of","God, who, how many believed Him?"]],[1605,["They crucified Him."]],[1607,["Because they were not realized souls."]],[1610,["But by giving you realization I have given","you that capacity to get all these three blessings"]],[1616,["at one shot."]],[1618,["I speak your language, I speak your style,","I live with your style, and you understand"]],[1623,["Me."]],[1624,["There is no problem."]],[1625,["But with other Gods, imagine if I were Mahakali","today, what would have happened."]],[1631,["You would be all upside-down there hanging,","seeing Me from the other way round."]],[1638,["I don't know what would have happened - or","any one of them."]],[1642,["So the three blessings that a saint is promised,","you've got all of them."]],[1653,["But because you've got them, you don't understand."]],[1660,["You take it for granted."]],[1661,["There's no shraddha."]],[1664,["With this experience there should be tremendous","faith."]],[1673,["Faith is a thing that resides between Me and","you, in between."]],[1681,["Is we can say, the ocean of joy that is in","between."]],[1685,["Whatever I emit to you is that shraddha, and","when you are drenched into it, the joy of"]],[1697,["that shraddha makes everything so sahaj."]],[1706,["But for that you must open your hearts."]],[1713,["A Sahaja yogi who is secretive, who is insular,","who is jealous, who separates himself from"]],[1723,["others is no good."]],[1726,["Open your heart."]],[1729,["Give away your things, doesn't matter."]],[1735,["Matter has only one value, that it can communicate","your Sahaj culture."]],[1741,["Little things, you see, I see something that","you have got beautiful, and in My Mahamaya"]],[1756,["acting on Myself I say, \"Oh, that's very beautiful.\""]],[1761,["and then they say, \"Mother, You gave us this.\""]],[1770,["\"Ah, sorry.\""]],[1773,["And then I feel very ashamed of Myself, that","this is not Sahaj culture, you see."]],[1778,["But the joy is so much that I can't help it","sometimes I say, \"Oh, I - it's so beautiful,"]],[1782,["this one.\""]],[1783,["\"You gave us, Mother.\""]],[1787,["And the whole rapport and the whole feeling;","I feeling a little shy about it, and all,"]],[1792,["they're so beautiful, so dramatic; so dramatic","it is, so poetic."]],[1800,["Only at that point I feel ashamed of Myself."]],[1803,["Of course to be human being you should be","ashamed of yourself sometimes."]],[1809,["Otherwise the drama is not complete."]],[1811,["So the whole thing is so beautiful and so","joyous."]],[1817,["But that gentleness towards others and yourself","should be there."]],[1823,["Now if you become unhappy and serious, you","are very unkind to yourself and to others."]],[1829,["Anybody who is a serious person, sits with","a serious face, know that he is not a Sahaja"]],[1835,["yogi at all."]],[1836,["They should be bubbling with laughter, joy","all the time."]],[1840,["I cannot be serious for more than, I think,","five seconds perhaps."]],[1845,["I don't know."]],[1847,["I try, because lectures should be serious","to go into the hearts of the people."]],[1852,["But there's not, and you can see that even","when I'm getting angry, My eyes betray Me,"]],[1858,["and there's a twinkle of laughter in the eyes."]],[1864,["That's how a person should be, and don't worry","what others have to say."]],[1870,["You see, the culture where people are just","glum like this, is the same as the people"]],[1876,["where they are frivolous."]],[1877,["Now as we can say American culture is to be","frivolous, stupid, you see, I won't be surprised"]],[1886,["supposing your Prime Minister tomorrow starts","wearing a sari, just to amuse you."]],[1888,["Anything is possible with them, just to amuse","you, you see, too - for cheap popularity."]],[1898,["Anything frivolous, stupid, they will do."]],[1900,["But supposing, you see, it is say an English","old conservative personality, then a lady"]],[1907,["might wear a very official dress with the","lines and this and that, and like a man she"]],[1916,["might become very soon, like that, develop","a very serious face."]],[1922,["But both things are nonsensical, has no meaning."]],[1926,["You have to be natural, and natural everything","is always bubbling with joy."]],[1933,["And a message."]],[1935,["And a message."]],[1936,["These flowers are the message of My coming,","writ large on them."]],[1944,["So a person who is a Sahaj culture man should","emit that message to others, people should"]],[1951,["see, \"Oh, this is the man."]],[1953,["He is the sahaja fellow.\""]],[1956,["You can see that clearly."]],[1957,["There's no seriousness, there's no unhappiness,","nothing."]],[1958,["Supposing I have said something that might","be upsetting you, forget it."]],[1964,["If you cannot forget that, then you have not","listened to Me."]],[1971,["But \"forget\" doesn't mean that you do not","act upon it."]],[1973,["\"Acting upon it\" means that you face yourself","and see for yourself how you have ascended"]],[1979,["and how far you have to go, not how you'll","fall down."]],[1983,["So it is all the time acting on both sides,","as I'm telling you in My lecture, that on"]],[1988,["one side you'll see to yourself as relationship","with Me, and relationship with others."]],[1995,["For a Sahaja yogi it should not matter whether","you are in a palace or on the street."]],[2008,["The first encounter with the first Sahaja","yogis - we have only one surviving, now here"]],[2012,["sitting down - they couldn't bear, for them","it was difficult to be in the beautiful atmosphere"]],[2020,["of India."]],[2021,["The reason is, they were analyzing: they have","no good bathrooms, no showers."]],[2027,["But you have the whole sky."]],[2030,["You have all the mountains."]],[2033,["You have all the trees."]],[2034,["You have got all the waters flowing."]],[2037,["But you want to have a little shower, in which","you can't even move."]],[2044,["Just an idea, just an idea of comfort."]],[2051,["You have no comforts, if you ask Me, compared","to what we have in India."]],[2056,["No comforts at all."]],[2058,["I mean, ask any Indian girl to come and stay,","she will cry."]],[2064,["Even I think here the President, the President","has to wash his utensils perhaps, maybe."]],[2070,["What a comfort."]],[2072,["There's no division of labor."]],[2076,["Now in our country we have servants, but \"servants\"","doesn't mean that we cheat them anything else."]],[2081,["They eat the same food as we eat."]],[2083,["They live the same way we live."]],[2085,["But they do different type of work, because","they don't have the same mental capacity to"]],[2089,["be the President."]],[2091,["The President does some other work."]],[2096,["You have no comfort of any kind, you take","it from Me."]],[2099,["Food matter, you get everything processed","food."]],[2102,["Imagine, any time you might be developing","cancer due to processed food."]],[2107,["What is your speciality then?"]],[2110,["Try to understand."]],[2112,["What is the kind of food: it's not fresh,","God knows how it is processed, how it is preserved,"]],[2117,["from where it is coming."]],[2118,["Suddenly in London they said that, \"Don't","eat this kind of food,\" you see, \"because"]],[2124,["it has got something contaminated.\""]],[2126,["So everybody rushes, you see, to the store","room, because we have to store up all these"]],[2131,["things."]],[2132,["You can't get at the right…."]],[2133,["\"Oh it's there\"; then you start throwing them","out."]],[2136,["It's a mad racing because people think that,","\"God knows what we are eating today, is it"]],[2146,["correct or not?\""]],[2148,["So food-wise you are zero."]],[2151,["Best thing is to live in the villages or in","the forests, to get the fresh fruits, wash"]],[2158,["them in clean flowing water of a river, eat","it nicely and sit down enjoying the sun."]],[2168,["The comfort of the spirit is the thing we","have lost, and those who seek the comfort"]],[2175,["of the spirit are Sahaja yogis, not otherwise."]],[2181,["Comfort of the spirit comes in giving."]],[2185,["Say I've borrowed some money from you, I won't","be comfortable till I've paid you back."]],[2192,["Going further with it, supposing you are caught","up into something, you have got some problems."]],[2199,["I'll somehow or other manage that you'll come","close to Me somewhere, and work it out on"]],[2204,["you, clear you out, finished."]],[2205,["Till then I won't be comfortable; though I'll","suffer, I'll have pains, I'll have this, that."]],[2210,["As soon as I came here, left Nabhi was like","this going on."]],[2214,["Corrected it."]],[2215,["I took it upon Myself, I sucked it into Me."]],[2219,["So they are adventurous."]],[2222,["\"Oh I will not touch, I am catching, he's","catching.\""]],[2227,["Finished."]],[2228,["But now the compassion can only work out if","you have that kind of a spirit, otherwise"]],[2233,["you cannot."]],[2234,["It becomes sympathy."]],[2236,["For example there's one person, Mr. A. or","Miss A. or Mrs. A., whatever it is."]],[2241,["I mean, I'm just talking of a common personality,","and that person is catching."]],[2247,["I would say in an ashram, that person should","clear out."]],[2251,["But all the ashramites will catch from that","person, and that person will never be all"]],[2256,["right."]],[2257,["There's a very nice joke about it."]],[2260,["There was a lady, she wanted to reduce herself."]],[2264,["So there was a machine like a rolling-pin."]],[2266,["They said, \"If you rub it, then you will reduce.\""]],[2270,["So she brought, poor thing, she brought the","machine and she started rolling it."]],[2275,["She found that the rolling-pin became fat,","instead of she reducing."]],[2286,["Same thing is in Sahaja yoga."]],[2290,["Instead of Sahaja yogis correcting the others,","they get contaminated."]],[2293,["That's why I said, \"Don't have anybody in","the ashram.\""]],[2295,["Because you sympathize."]],[2299,["You do not try to correct that person, in","a way that you can correct within yourselves,"]],[2304,["suck it within yourself as your Mother does,","and do it."]],[2306,["I do it for thousands and thousands and thousands;","you have to do it for one or two, so you are"]],[2312,["never bothered."]],[2313,["And that's how you become strong."]],[2314,["Not by shunning them, running away from them","or condemning yourself, or saying that: \"We"]],[2319,["must save ourselves on the boat.\""]],[2323,["No."]],[2324,["Through adventure."]],[2325,["\"Let's see what happens\"."]],[2327,["Tamara was telling Me, \"Nothing catches me,","Mother, what is it?\""]],[2330,["I said: \"But who will catch you?"]],[2333,["Those who will catch will be hurt themselves.\""]],[2339,["So what is it, that Bhairava is to be established."]],[2342,["Sidha kala mane Bhairav' - as you have to","establish Shri Ganesha, you have to establish"]],[2349,["also Bhairava, and Hanumana on the right side."]],[2351,["If these three deities you establish within","yourself, nothing, nothing on this earth can"]],[2357,["catch you."]],[2358,["You'll catch it for a while."]],[2362,["But what I find now, I came to this ashram,","everybody's left Nabhi caught up."]],[2366,["Everybody's left Agnya caught up."]],[2370,["So then I get the pain."]],[2372,["Everyone."]],[2373,["I mean, I have put you inside My body, do","you know that?"]],[2376,["You are part and parcel of My body, you are","the cells in My body."]],[2381,["And when you catch, I also catch; not catch,","but I really get the pain, but I clear it."]],[2390,["In the same way, I have given you powers."]],[2393,["Every power I have, I have given you."]],[2401,["But you have to develop it and you have to","be adventurous."]],[2408,["But on the contrary, once we have ashrams,","everybody settles down, \"Oh, now, very comfortable,"]],[2413,["very cheap.\""]],[2414,["Very economical, that's the first comfort."]],[2418,["It's surprising, for a Western person, it","is very important that it should be economical,"]],[2428,["surprising, affluent people think more of","saving money than the people who are poor."]],[2436,["And English are the last word, save pounds,","at the cost of others."]],[2446,["On the contrary if you go to India, where","they’ll be very happy, they'll invite you"]],[2449,["in their house."]],[2451,["Whatever they have they will give it to you,","\"Eat, eat, eat.\""]],[2454,["They'll force you."]],[2455,["They'll be very happy to give."]],[2457,["But in England it's very dangerous, you see."]],[2461,["Sometimes in the ashram they may not even","have food for Me."]],[2464,["Really."]],[2466,["And if you tell them, \"I know."]],[2468,["I know.\""]],[2469,["You know."]],[2470,["Finished."]],[2471,["Then what do you say?"]],[2472,["They already know it, now what to do?"]],[2474,["They know."]],[2475,["So with the affluence miserliness grows, and","money-orientation."]],[2483,["In India also I've seen people who get little","more money than the rest become very money-oriented."]],[2489,["Money becomes everything, money becomes the","power, money becomes their life."]],[2494,["Sahaja yogi doesn't care for money."]],[2497,["Just.. is the dust of our Mother's feet."]],[2502,["What is money, what is wealth?"]],[2505,["And when they do like that, then their money","problems are solved."]],[2511,["If you have a money problem, know that there's","a problem."]],[2514,["If you are very particular about money."]],[2520,["I am, in a way, because if I have to give","somebody, I remember it."]],[2524,["But I've seen people who are very anxious","to tell Me that, \"You have to pay this man"]],[2528,["so much, that man so much.\""]],[2529,["That's wrong."]],[2530,["That's not your look-out."]],[2533,["That's very, very wrong to tell Me that, \"You","have to pay this man or that man.\""]],[2538,["It's not important."]],[2540,["Even if I don't pay, I pay him."]],[2543,["So in relationship with Me, you are not to","tell Me that, \"You have to pay so much money"]],[2549,["to him, this much money should be paid, this","is what he owes You.\""]],[2553,["Nothing of the kind."]],[2554,["Let the person come and tell Me."]],[2557,["Why are you telling?"]],[2558,["That kind of a message if you give Me, you","are lost."]],[2563,["Or if you come and tell Me for somebody else","that, \"Mother, time is up, we have to go."]],[2568,["Somebody is hurrying You up.\""]],[2571,["If somebody is hurrying Me, tell him, \"Don't","hurry Mother.\""]],[2577,["You must know that your kundalinis were not","raised with just your own kundalini, but something"]],[2589,["that is working it out."]],[2591,["Something very tremendous, a big organization."]],[2596,["You can't see it, it is microscopic."]],[2600,["You must know, nobody got realization like","that, did they?"]],[2604,["Thousands getting realization, what's happening?"]],[2606,["There must be something about…"]],[2608,["Now how can you tell anything to such an organization?"]],[2614,["They don't like it."]],[2615,["They know it."]],[2616,["Actually they are the ones who know, not the","English."]],[2620,["They know what is to be done."]],[2623,["So your relationship with Me acts as your","culture."]],[2630,["So it is a Mother's cult, you can call it,","the Mother's culture."]],[2636,["How we are connected with our Mother."]],[2639,["I have seen people, if somebody is rude to","them, they get very angry."]],[2646,["But if somebody is rude to Me they don't feel","angry."]],[2649,["It should be the other way round."]],[2653,["Now I'll give you an example."]],[2656,["This Merv Griffin was funny, and both our","PRO’s were very angry."]],[2663,["It was natural and very…"]],[2664,["I mean, I liked it, but I calmed them down."]],[2668,["And Worlikar of course was on top of this","thing."]],[2670,["But the other fellow would not."]],[2673,["He was giving arguments."]],[2676,["I was just watching."]],[2677,["I mean, if somebody had said this to his mother..."]],[2681,["There's another one there, he never came to","receive Me at the airport."]],[2689,["So Worlikar said, \"If your own mother had","come, you would not have gone?\""]],[2700,["Then one can give explanation, \"Oh, but our","Mother is Adi Shakti."]],[2703,["My mother is not, she's helpless.\""]],[2706,["It's not."]],[2707,["To show your respect, to show your love, you","have to go; for your own gain, not for Her"]],[2712,["gain."]],[2713,["For your own gain."]],[2717,["This relationship is for your own gain."]],[2720,["Supposing if you strike oil, is it for your","gain or for the gain of the oil?"]],[2730,["If you get to the Source, is it for the Source","to gain anything, or it is for you to gain"]],[2736,["anything?"]],[2737,["Logic, simple logic."]],[2740,["So in that culture, you see, you really thrive","and you become extremely a happy person, a"]],[2749,["joyous person."]],[2752,["And the expression of such a person is so","different, because such a person, as I told"]],[2761,["you, rises above and sees the problems of","others, the decadence of the society, sees"]],[2768,["all the problems of the world."]],[2773,["Not only that, but knows the solutions."]],[2777,["We are not like these ordinary people who","have racialism, this.. other diseases, I don't"]],[2787,["know what sort of diseases they have, I also","forget."]],[2790,["Racialism now, it's another stupid nonsense,","you know."]],[2792,["What is racialism?"]],[2794,["God has made somebody's color like this and","somebody's color like that, and those same"]],[2800,["racists are trying to tan their faces."]],[2811,["So in this culture of ours we are not bothered","about superficial things."]],[2818,["What we are bothered about is our inner cleanliness,","inner beauty, but that doesn't mean that you"]],[2827,["should move about like primitive people, no."]],[2833,["But if there is inner beauty, then outer beauty","comes."]],[2836,["You will never find Me dirtily dressed."]],[2838,["You will never find Me without a sari on,","even when I sleep I wear a sari, because in"]],[2844,["the night also I have to work, so how can","I go in My dressing-gown to the other world?"]],[2855,["So a person who is a Sahaja yogi has to be","an extremely neat and a clean person, but"]],[2862,["not to tell others, but should be himself","or herself."]],[2866,["That's one of the things are very important,","because others will see you, like loonies,"]],[2871,["who's going to believe you?"]],[2873,["So the one effect is from the Mother, you","take from the Source, for what?"]],[2879,["To be that illuminated quality, in you, so","that others see you as something great and"]],[2888,["adore you, worship you."]],[2892,["This is this far we have come, now, how your","personality should be."]],[2897,["But now, when you are dealing with others,","know that they are human beings made by God,"]],[2903,["not by Sahaja yogis by any chance."]],[2908,["And they will be tomorrow's Sahaja yogis,","may be higher Sahaja yogis than you."]],[2913,["So when we are dealing with others also, talk","to them in a gentle way."]],[2920,["Be kind to them."]],[2921,["Of course we are against gurus, against cults,","against all these people."]],[2925,["But as soon as they come, if you say: \"Oh,","you are a bhoot\", the person will do right-about-turn"]],[2932,["and go away."]],[2936,["So you are not given this power to be abrupt","or to be arrogant with others, not given."]],[2947,["Now all such people are coming down, calming","down because they see that what helps is your"]],[2955,["gentle, kindly, firm attitude."]],[2960,["Only after Sahaja Yoga you can combine all","these qualities."]],[2963,["You'll be firm, you'll be alert, you'll be","gentle and compassionate, smiling, but not"]],[2972,["making fun of others."]],[2973,["So then you become a personality who is alert:","to see what is the reaction they're having"]],[2983,["on others, this is very important to be seen."]],[2986,["So now you start witnessing others."]],[2990,["What is your reaction on others?"]],[2992,["I have seen many a times, a new Sahaja yogi","comes in."]],[2997,["The person is trying to say something, and","the girl starts giggling or laughing."]],[3004,["One should not, at that time, because the","person might think that, \"They're making fool"]],[3009,["of me, or they're thinking that I'm a stupid","person, or something wrong with me.\""]],[3015,["That person will become self-conscious, I","won't be able to give realization to that"]],[3018,["person."]],[3020,["But if somebody is sitting before Me and I'm","trying to help that person, know that it's"]],[3027,["a very important moment of this gentleman's","life."]],[3033,["We have got it, so what?"]],[3035,["When we are pulling out somebody, when we","are helping out somebody, do we laugh?"]],[3042,["That's the time you have to be very concerned","and very much serious, to do the job."]],[3051,["Every quality and mood has its own place,","like nose is at its own place, eyes at its"]],[3057,["own place."]],[3058,["In the same way, all these moods that we have,","have their own places."]],[3067,["And that is what is lost in modern society."]],[3073,["So when I am trying to help somebody, you","should be all concern about that person."]],[3080,["How does this come in to us from the Source?"]],[3084,["How much you are concerned about Me?"]],[3087,["Supposing I am thirsty, you will feel thirsty."]],[3093,["You'll immediately say, \"Mother, I'll get","You some water.\""]],[3096,["But you may not even ask Me, just bring it","here, keep it there."]],[3100,["Or just make some tea for Me or look after","Me."]],[3103,["Do this or do that."]],[3107,["In little, little things you should watch."]],[3110,["The concern is not in saying something, asking","something."]],[3113,["You don't ask."]],[3115,["Don't ask Mother, you just do it."]],[3124,["That's how, when you start doing it, you will","understand what you are doing to others."]],[3129,["So the reflection on others, how they reflect","about you also is very important, and you"]],[3136,["have to be alert."]],[3140,["Suddenly you say something, and everybody","disappears."]],[3143,["You must know they are not yet Sahaja yogis,","they are to be brought in, so you have to"]],[3147,["very carefully bring them around."]],[3154,["Then with Sahaja yogis, among yourselves how","you behave is extremely important for others"]],[3161,["to see."]],[3163,["We must cherish each other's company, we must","cherish."]],[3171,["To meet some Sahaja yogi somewhere, \"Ah, what","a joy it is to see someone, to talk to someone"]],[3175,["on the phone.\""]],[3177,["But because we are so insular, so selfish,","so greedy, and sometimes very circumcised"]],[3184,["[should read 'circumscribed'] I should say,","or absolutely engulfed into our past, we cannot"]],[3193,["do that, we do not feel that joy, we cannot","adore another Sahaja yogi, we do not enjoy"]],[3199,["another Sahaja yogi, we cannot cherish his","company."]],[3205,["That means this finger cannot feel this finger."]],[3210,["It's like a developing, what you call, a disease","called leprosy."]],[3215,["Nerves are finished."]],[3217,["Nerve endings are not there."]],[3220,["You cannot feel the joy of other Sahaja yogis."]],[3229,["And this is only possible if you get over","your personal interests."]],[3236,["When people come in Sahaja Yoga in the beginning,","they have personal interests, like say somebody"]],[3244,["is trying to sell something, so they would","like to sell it to Sahaja yogis."]],[3251,["Or they are arranging something, they would","like Sahaja yogis to do it."]],[3256,["See, personal interest, to use Sahaja yogis","for their own purposes."]],[3260,["As a result of that I've seen some people","become so insular that nobody helps them,"]],[3268,["no work is done by them; if there's a telephone,","nobody will say, \"I'll get it.\""]],[3273,["That's American quality, they'll say, \"I'll","get it.\""]],[3276,["Is regarded good."]],[3277,["Not in England, they'll be all sitting, quiet."]],[3284,["Even when they have eaten the food, they have","to pay the money, they'll look this side,"]],[3289,["and some poor Indian student will pay for","all of them."]],[3294,["\"I won't look\", they say."]],[3295,["\"Now paid.\""]],[3296,["Now they are normal."]],[3298,["It's very low-level."]],[3302,["Is extremely low-level behavior."]],[3307,["And this is what one has to learn, that you","have to cherish others, give presents to others."]],[3319,["\"You're going there; “Oh, now…\"; like","the other day I met a lady, she had liked"]],[3328,["one of My rings of emerald."]],[3333,["That's My family ring so I can't give away,","you see, I'll have to ask C.P. and he may"]],[3339,["not like it, because after all I have no right","on it, I have to give it to My children, all"]],[3344,["right?"]],[3345,["But I found an emerald somewhere, beautiful,","so I kept it with Me."]],[3349,["The other day when I gave her, she was so","enamored."]],[3351,["I said, \"You liked My ring, I couldn't give","you My ring, so..\""]],[3355,["She said to Me, \"You mean to say, I would","have taken Your ring?\""]],[3359,["I said, \"I would have forced it on you, but","I couldn't give you, so I thought of it."]],[3363,["I just saw it somewhere so I got it for you.\""]],[3366,["She said, \"How thoughtful.\""]],[3367,["But it's all in My head."]],[3370,["I, whenever I get it, a chance, you see, so","somebody says, \"Oh, I like it\", keep it in"]],[3380,["mind."]],[3381,["Next time, even a flower."]],[3384,["You must cherish their companies, because","it's such a great thing to have somebody who"]],[3389,["understands you, your spirit, and they have","the spirit."]],[3392,["Such a great thing."]],[3394,["How can you be unkind to each other?"]],[3399,["That hurts Me the most of all."]],[3401,["And the first thing and the foremost thing","you have to give Me is congenial, beautiful,"]],[3410,["loving group, that they love each other."]],[3419,["If that's achieved, that you really love,","beyond your personal considerations."]],[3423,["I mean, of course, in Sahaja Yoga there are","now not many people who try to make money,"]],[3431,["but try to make comfort for themselves."]],[3433,["They must have the best room, they must have","the best place, they must have..."]],[3436,["\"I didn't get this, I should have it, this,","that.\""]],[3439,["Try to do more than others."]],[3441,["I know sometimes people take advantage of","you, but they will go out of Sahaja Yoga very"]],[3447,["soon."]],[3448,["So be sure that you become generous about","it, very generous."]],[3452,["And generosity should start from your own","Sahaja yogi brothers and sisters."]],[3464,["In the culture of Sahaja Yoga we have to have","a full imbibement bubbling through our nerves,"]],[3473,["the sense of chastity."]],[3477,["That is a must, whether you like it or not."]],[3483,["There should be no bad intentions about any","other person, of relationships which are not"]],[3495,["pure."]],[3496,["Absolutely pure relationships, pure eyes without","any adultery, adulteration I would call it."]],[3508,["Clean eyes is the basic of Sahaja Yoga."]],[3518,["Steadfast clean eyes, because your eyes are","very powerful."]],[3524,["You don't know how powerful they are."]],[3530,["So to make it that way, to practice, move","your attention inward and towards the Sahasrara."]],[3542,["You can."]],[3543,["With your eyes you suck in."]],[3547,["Even by looking at Me with the shraddha, with","the joy, you just suck it inside, My image."]],[3555,["Put it on your Sahasrara, put it in your heart,","you can do it."]],[3562,["It's very joy giving."]],[3565,["When you put it in the Sahasrara, then you","get the knowledge."]],[3570,["When you put it in your heart, you get the","joy; and when you put it on your liver, then"]],[3578,["you get the power of action."]],[3583,["From the photograph also you can do it, suck","in, move it."]],[3589,["But that is shown in the way you behave towards","others, completely confident, gentle; no arrogance."]],[3600,["Neither the neck up like that or like that,","but in the center in a very dignified manner."]],[3613,["So in the culture of Sahaj, because the spirit","is the dignity, is the majesty, is the glory"]],[3627,["of God, you have to judge yourself."]],[3631,["\"Did I say something which is not respecting","my spirit?"]],[3637,["Did I do something that is not glorious?\""]],[3644,["Like I've seen people, when I'm there, they'll","go on asking Me hundred questions."]],[3648,["\"Should it be white towel?"]],[3650,["Green towel?"]],[3651,["Should I do this, should I do that?\""]],[3656,["Why?"]],[3658,["Because we don't live with choices."]],[3660,["We live with whatever we get it, and there","is dignity in that."]],[3665,["If you start doing choices, it's stupid."]],[3671,["In a group of Sahaja yogis, the food, \"What","will you have?\""]],[3676,["They'll take forty-five minutes to decide,","if you go in a restaurant, because the first,"]],[3680,["the consciousness, \"We are paying for it\",","and somebody will have this, somebody will"]],[3685,["have that."]],[3686,["The poor waiter will run away."]],[3688,["But why should we have different?"]],[3692,["It's just the same."]],[3696,["Whatever Mother is having we'll have, finished."]],[3703,["But if not that, at least whatever everybody","is having, \"Why have separately?\""]],[3707,["Choices are not there in Sahaja Yoga, remember","this word very clearly."]],[3711,["Choices of this, choices of that, I don't","like it, I like that."]],[3715,["This is not good, that is not good."]],[3720,["Because we need everything on the level of","vibrations, then the choice is coming."]],[3728,["Like, if the vibrations are not good we'll","not say it, but we'll not have it."]],[3738,["But not question of whether green or red or","yellow or white."]],[3743,["And that is what they are making fool out","of you."]],[3746,["They will put one name, Cartier, finished."]],[3752,["People will pay any amount for that Cartier."]],[3756,["Is any ordinary stuff, it is nothing special."]],[3761,["But you see that ego, \"I've got the Cartier."]],[3763,["I paid more to show that I've paid more, that","I've been a fool.\""]],[3768,["To pay more for something that's so cheapish;","that's what they're playing upon - remember"]],[3776,["that."]],[3777,["So you have to understand that when you are","a Sahaj personality, you have your own dignity."]],[3786,["These things do not give dignity to you."]],[3789,["You give them dignity."]],[3795,["But that doesn't mean tomorrow you come like","a clown, or like a limbo on your nose."]],[3804,["Of course I must see the other point always,","because it just slips out that side."]],[3810,["When you become dignified, you will wear always","something that is dignified."]],[3817,["You will do all that is dignified."]],[3819,["Is automatically you become dignified."]],[3822,["It's nothing artificial."]],[3825,["So dignity that comes, as you see your Mother."]],[3833,["Whatever you give Me in Puja I take it, all","right, but otherwise you cannot give Me anything"]],[3839,["else."]],[3840,["If you give Me, I'll return it, somehow."]],[3846,["Somehow I'll return it."]],[3849,["A person who is money-oriented cannot have","dignity, because you see him like a beggar."]],[3856,["See, if there’s money-orientation is too","much, he comes down to that level, you can"]],[3859,["see it, there cannot be dignity there."]],[3861,["A man who is power-oriented is an idiot."]],[3866,["He looks like an idiot."]],[3869,["So we cannot become idiots."]],[3870,["All right."]],[3871,["So we cannot be power-oriented."]],[3874,["The one who is sort of a romantic or a love-oriented,","is a stupid fellow."]],[3882,["He behaves like a stupid fellow."]],[3884,["On the street they go on kissing each other","all the time."]],[3888,["\"Where are you going?\""]],[3889,["\"To the divorce case, but last bit we are","thinking of having some kisses.\""]],[3896,["Self-respect is the thing."]],[3900,["Self is your spirit."]],[3901,["The respect of the spirit should give you","that dignity."]],[3905,["But in privacy you are gentle with your husband,","you are gentle with your wife."]],[3911,["You must learn how to be gentle with her in","privacy, not in public."]],[3918,["That's horrible."]],[3920,["Specially in India."]],[3921,["I am told that people go round with that romanticism","and all that."]],[3925,["So please, don't do all those romantic stuff","in India, it's very embarrassing for Me, very"]],[3931,["embarrassing."]],[3932,["So we cannot do things which embarrasses our","Mother."]],[3937,["Once you start knowing that, \"This will embarrass","Mother, we can't do this\", automatically you"]],[3942,["are helping."]],[3943,["So when it is related with Me, immediately,","\"What will Mother think of in me?"]],[3949,["Is this the way to behave towards Mother?\""]],[3951,["Immediately you will get the reward, as that","thing working through you, as if you become"]],[3963,["that nature."]],[3964,["Sahaja culture is a sahaja nature."]],[3968,["Automatically you will do it."]],[3971,["You'll talk in that manner, you will speak","in that manner, you’ll live in that manner."]],[3978,["I mean, I have seen people who have never","known Me, on a trunk call or a telephone,"]],[3984,["they recognize."]],[3985,["They know I am something special; if they","are sensitive enough."]],[3990,["From My photograph, the way I sit, the way","I talk, immediately everyone asks."]],[3995,["The other day where I went for the meeting","with My husband, everybody was asking, \"Who"]],[3999,["is this lady?\""]],[4000,["\"Who is this lady?\""]],[4001,["\"Who is this lady?\""]],[4005,["There's something in the personality."]],[4006,["I talk to everyone nicely, I'm very sweet."]],[4013,["We cannot be slavish, and we cannot enslave","anyone."]],[4016,["We have to cherish, even human beings we have","to cherish, because they are us."]],[4024,["Not to despise anyone, not to laugh at anyone."]],[4030,["In the culture of Sahaj, you have to become","an expert: expertise."]],[4037,["Expertise comes through your adherence to","your Mother."]],[4045,["Expertise: you all should be an expert, and","who will give you the certificate is your"]],[4049,["Mother only - who else?"]],[4052,["I may not say so, but your spirit will say","that, and not your ego."]],[4061,["In this short time whatever was possible,","it's such a big subject, culture is; you cannot."]],[4067,["But I've talked to you, I would not say in","a very analytical way, but in a very synthetic"]],[4074,["manner."]],[4076,["So I've given you very synthesis of the whole","thing."]],[4079,["\"Analytical\" would be one, two, three, four,","five - cut short - two, three, four, five,"]],[4086,["like that."]],[4087,["It's not like that."]],[4089,["And that is how you have to speak to people."]],[4091,["One, this is so; two, this is so; three, this","is so; finished."]],[4096,["You are not Sahaja yogis."]],[4098,["In your speeches if you talk like that, finished."]],[4105,["But before saying something or doing something,","give a little idea where you are leading the"]],[4111,["people, so they are not frittered away, attention","is not frittered away."]],[4118,["Give a little idea, as I say, or else while","talking, bring them to a point which is important,"]],[4129,["so that they wait in the sentence to come","to that point."]],[4135,["But make the whole sentence look so, that","it is going towards certain points, so always"]],[4142,["a Sahaja yogi must make a point out of what","they talk, not just babbling, talking."]],[4151,["What is the point you are going to make?"]],[4155,["Whatever they do, they have to know, \"What","are we going to achieve out of it?\""]],[4161,["Now, marriage."]],[4162,["\"What are we going to achieve out of marriage?\""]],[4165,["A family, house, everybody has, even a donkey","has that."]],[4169,["What's so great?"]],[4171,["We are going to achieve a family unit where","realized souls are to be born, we're going"]],[4177,["to look after them in a proper way, and then","we are going to emit that unit into this world,"]],[4188,["like a sparkling diamond set in the beautiful","setting of a family, giving light to the whole"]],[4196,["world."]],[4199,["So one's life should not be pointless, and","talk should not be pointless, and every moment"]],[4209,["should be filled with achievements of your","visions and dreams, slowly and steadily, which"]],[4220,["is not at all difficult."]],[4226,["If you can get rid of ego and superego, finished,","that's all - simple as that."]],[4232,["May God bless you all."]],[4243,["Mm.. good.. nice.. relaxed, eh?"]],[4253,["Relaxed."]],[4255,["Witness."]],[4257,["Everyone cleared out, I think."]],[4266,["And no more… one more thing I must say last,","as I've said it before, which I've not said"]],[4272,["here, no-one is going to say that bhoot did","it, because such a person will be sent away"]],[4278,["to the bhoot clan, not to Sahaja Yoga."]],[4282,["Don't put your responsibility on the bhoots."]],[4287,["Either you are a bhoot or you are a Sahaja","yogi, one of the two, you can't be both."]]]);
